# Kept out of the PUBLIC repo on purpose. GitHub Pages needs a public repo on a
# free account, and none of the below has to be public for the site to work.
#
#   content/          the marketing + sales playbook. Positioning, objection
#                     handling and the review process — do not hand this to
#                     competitors. Back it up somewhere private instead.
#   ClientImages/     the original crew photography. The graded, published
#                     versions already ship in docs/assets/img/. Only needed
#                     locally if you re-run build/grade.py.
#   source-art/       original logo artwork, superseded by brand/.
#
# Delete a line below if you decide you want it versioned here.
content/
ClientImages/
source-art/
site-v1-archive/

